    {
      "text": "Cropped forest plot fragment for people living with HIV with CD4 count <200: one study (Spooner 2022) with TP 14, FP 8, FN 9, TN 204, sensitivity 0.61 (0.39–0.80) and specificity 0.96 (0.93–0.98). The heading of the next subgroup (CD4 count ≥200) is cut off at the bottom.",
